  "description": "A modern, flexible WebSocket library for .NET that makes it easy to build robust\n      servers and clients.\n      Built on System.Net.WebSockets.WebSocket abstract class with extensive additional features.\n      Targets .NET Standard 2.0 and .NET 9, with compatibility back to .NET Framework 4.7.2\n      Works cross-platform (Windows, Linux, macOS) without HTTP.sys dependencies.\n\n      Features fluent builder APIs for both server and client, auto-reconnect with exponential\n      backoff,\n      per-message deflate compression, SSL/TLS support, CORS, authentication hooks, comprehensive\n      logging,\n      and connection state monitoring. Includes demo applications and extensive documentation for\n      easy adoption.",
